{"lesson_uid":"L0046","_provenance":{"generator":"backend/scripts/generate_lesson_zhuyin.py","reading_authority":"frontend/src/components/zhuyin/polyphonicProcessor.ts（跑，非移植）","source_font":"frontend/public/fonts/BpmfZihiSerif-Regular.ttf","font_sha256_16":"fc25a90d27699ec4","poyin_db_sha256_16":"882bc0ae69aeef35","notation":"pypinyin BopomofoConverter（與 font_readings.json 同一個轉換器）","stats":{"texts":209,"chars":5427,"poly_positions":1602,"he_adjudicated":2,"manual_corrections":0}},"texts":[{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"vcn7j","idx":1,"text":"你知道嗎？植物在地球上已經存在超過四億年。經過漫長的演化，植物發展出各式各樣的驚人適應能力。它們的生存智慧，為科學家帶來無限的啟發，讓我們一起看看這些「植物老師」如何引領科學家走上創新之路！","n":95,"ssz":"..........................................1..........................2........................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"vcn7j","idx":2,"text":"當楓樹的種子從樹上飄落時，會像小直升機一樣旋轉降落。這種特別的飛行方式讓它們能夠被風帶到更遠的地方，找到適合生長的新家。科學家受到楓樹種子的啟發，設計了一種名叫沙馬雷的飛行機器人！","n":90,"ssz":".....1.............1...................................1............1.......2............."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"vcn7j","idx":3,"text":"沙馬雷和一般的無人機不一樣，它只有一片翅膀，因此構造簡單，體積更小，更省電，而且沒電時，它會盤旋而下，比較不會摔壞！它和一般無人機一樣，可以垂直起降，在狹窄的空間靈活飛行。內建攝影機時，可以幫助人類進行搜救、環境監測，甚至探索危機四伏、險象環生的災難現場。","n":128,"ssz":"...12......1.........................................1.....12....1..........................................................1..."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"vcn7j","idx":4,"text":"還沒開花的向日葵花苞，早晨朝向東方，到了下午則轉向西方，整天彷彿在追逐太陽！這種「向陽性」讓科學家發明了一種能自動調整角度的仿生太陽能板，讓太陽能發電變得更有效率！","n":82,"ssz":"..............................1.....................2.......................1....."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"vcn7j","idx":5,"text":"一般的太陽能板角度是固定的，當太陽移動後，吸收陽光的效率就會降低。但這種仿生設計模仿向日葵的特性，讓太陽能板可以「跟著太陽轉」，整天都能吸收到最多陽光，發電量大幅提升。這項技術已經在多個國家被應用，為地球提供更多乾淨能源！","n":111,"ssz":"............................................................................................1...1.............."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"vcn7j","idx":6,"text":"西部電影中，常看到有些乾草球在荒涼的大地上滾來滾去，那就是風滾草！風滾草其實是某些植物成熟或枯死後，由枯乾的莖葉形成的大草球。強風吹起時，草球就會在原野上翻滾和轉動，藉此散播種子。","n":90,"ssz":"...............................................................................1........1."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"vcn7j","idx":7,"text":"這種靠風「滾來滾去」的方式，也讓科學家有了探索火星的新點子！火星地表有許多崎嶇難行的地形，原本的火星探測器在這些地方移動得很慢。科學家便想到：如果探測器能像風滾草一樣，靠風在廣闊無垠的火星地表上滾動，就能前往更多地方蒐集資料。於是，他們設計出一種像大球的探測器，裡面裝著科學儀器，可以一邊滾動，一邊記錄火星各地的環境。","n":159,"ssz":"............................1...............................1....................1.......................................2....................2....2..........."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"vcn7j","idx":8,"text":"科學家從動物、植物獲取靈感，模仿它們的特性，設計出有用的科技產品，這門學問叫做仿生學。植物看似不動，但它們經過億萬年的演化，擁有許多聰明的生存技巧，為人類帶來無限啟發。下次，當你看到身邊的花草樹木，不妨仔細觀察，說不定也會從植物身上激發出好點子呢！","n":124,"ssz":"...............................................1..........................1................................1.............1.."},{"section":"key_reading","slug":"ny7wv","idx":null,"text":"沙馬雷和一般的無人機不一樣，它只有一片翅膀，因此構造簡單，體積更小，更省電，而且沒電時，它會盤旋而下，比較不會摔壞！它和一般無人機一樣，可以垂直起降，在狹窄的空間靈活飛行。內建攝影機時，可以幫助人類進行搜救、環境監測，甚至探索危機四伏、險象環生的災難現場。還沒開花的向日葵花苞，早晨朝向東方，到了下午則轉向西方，整天彷彿在追逐太陽！這種「向陽性」讓科學家發明了一種能自動調整角度的仿生太陽能板，讓太陽能發電變得更有效率！一般的太陽能板角度是固定的，當太陽移動後，吸收陽光的效率就會降低。但這種仿生設計模仿向日葵的特性，讓太陽能板可以「跟著太陽轉」，整天都能吸收到最多陽光，發電量大幅提升。這項技術已經在多個國家被應用，為地球提供更多乾淨能源！","n":321,"ssz":"...12......1.........................................1.....12....1..........................................................1.................................1.....................2.......................1.....2...........................................................................................1...1.............."},{"section":"served:series","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一般","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:title","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"以植物為師的科學","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:genre","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"說明文","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"拆詞釋義──藉由拆解字詞來推測詞義","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy_explained","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這一課我們要練習「拆開字詞，猜猜意思」的本領\n這篇文章裡面有很多關於「仿生學」的新名詞，像是「楓樹種子」、「向日葵」、「風滾草」等等，把這些詞拆開來，就可以更容易了解它們的意思，還有科學家從這些植物身上學到了什麼\n讀的時候，看到不懂的詞，可以試試看把這個詞拆成小小的字，猜猜看每個字的意思，也許就能連起來，弄懂整個詞的意思喔","n":162,"ssz":".1...............2................................1..............................1.....2......................................1............1...2............1...2."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy_explained#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這一課我們要練習「拆開字詞，猜猜意思」的本領","n":22,"ssz":".1...............2...."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy_explained#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這篇文章裡面有很多關於「仿生學」的新名詞，像是「楓樹種子」、「向日葵」、「風滾草」等等，把這些詞拆開來，就可以更容易了解它們的意思，還有科學家從這些植物身上學到了什麼","n":83,"ssz":"...........................1..............................1.....2.................."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy_explained#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讀的時候，看到不懂的詞，可以試試看把這個詞拆成小小的字，猜猜看每個字的意思，也許就能連起來，弄懂整個詞的意思喔","n":55,"ssz":"...................1............1...2............1...2."},{"section":"served:intro.background","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這篇文章要帶大家認識「仿生學」，也就是科學家如何從大自然中的生物身上獲得靈感，進而發明出各種新科技。文章以植物為主角，介紹了楓樹種子如何啟發科學家設計出小巧省電的飛行機器人；向日葵追逐太陽的特性，如何幫助科學家發明出更有效率的太陽能板；還有風滾草滾動散播種子的方式，又如何讓科學家構思出能在火星上滾動的探測器。透過這些有趣的例子，你會發現植物看似平凡，卻蘊藏著許多值得我們學習的生存智慧，也為人類的科技發展帶來了無限可能。","n":211,"ssz":".........................................................1.......1..............................................................1..................................1...................1...........1..............."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[0].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[0].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讀全文-做記號","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[1].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"二","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[1].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"念順順","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[2].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"三","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[2].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"閱讀聚光燈","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[2].subtitle","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"詞彙推測策略─拆詞釋義","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[3].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"四","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[3].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"語詞我最棒","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[4].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"五","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[4].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"語詞應用","n":4,"ssz":"..1."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[5].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"六","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[5].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文章重點表","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[6].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"七","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[6].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"閱讀理解","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[7].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"八","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[7].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"詞語複習","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[8].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"九","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[8].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"知識補給站","n":5,"ssz":"...1."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[0].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"仿生學","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[0].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"模仿生物的構造或特性，設計產品或技術的學問。","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:vocabulary[1].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"廣闊無垠","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[1].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"形容廣大、寬闊，沒有邊界。","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[2].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"盤旋","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[2].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"在空中繞圈飛行；也可形容想法一直留在腦中。","n":21,"ssz":"..............2......"},{"section":"served:vocabulary[3].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"危機四伏","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[3].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"到處隱藏著危險。","n":8,"ssz":".1......"},{"section":"served:vocabulary[4].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"險象環生","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[4].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"危險的狀況一直出現。","n":10,"ssz":".....2...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[5].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"向陽性","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[5].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"植物朝向陽光生長的特性。","n":12,"ssz":".......1...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[6].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"引領","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[6].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"引導、帶領。","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:vocabulary[7].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"崎嶇難行","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[7].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"地面高低不平，很難行走。","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:vocabulary[8].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"內建","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[8].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"機器或系統中原本就裝有某種配件或功能。","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[9].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"追逐","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[9].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"從後面追趕。","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:vocabulary[10].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"垂直起降","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[10].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"垂直起飛和降落。","n":8,"ssz":"....1..."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[0].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"戰場上雖然（　），但將士們仍然無所畏懼，勇往直前。（可複選）","n":30,"ssz":"..........1..................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[1].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小朋友在操場上互相（　）著，嘻嘻哈哈真開心。","n":22,"ssz":"........1............."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[2].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"救援隊冒著暴雨和落石前進，過程（　），最後終於找到受困者。","n":29,"ssz":".......1....................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[3].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"科技進步（　）我們走進新的數位時代。","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[4].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這支手機（　）多種拍照功能。","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[5].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"站在山頂上，看著（　）的綠色草原，心情格外愉快。","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[6].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"教室窗邊的植物具有（　），枝葉總是朝著陽光生長。","n":24,"ssz":"......................1."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[7].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"與同學的人際關係一直困擾著我，各種想法在腦海中（　），始終找不到答案。","n":35,"ssz":"........2.....................1...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請問哪一個句子使用語詞正確？","n":14,"ssz":"....1.1......."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"美術比賽競爭激烈，參賽者精心準備，現場氣氛「險象環生」","n":27,"ssz":"..........................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"考試前夕，失敗的念頭一直在腦中「盤旋」，讓我失眠了","n":25,"ssz":"..........2.............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我「引領」著我家的寵物貓和狗去公園散步","n":19,"ssz":"............1......"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他對數學的興趣「廣闊無垠」，總是喜歡研究各種題目","n":24,"ssz":".....1.................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據本文，下列發明與其功能的對應關係，何者描述不正確？","n":27,"ssz":"...............1.......1..."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"單翼飛行機器人——可垂直起飛，在狹窄空間移動","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"仿生太陽能板——能調整角度，提高吸收陽光的效率","n":23,"ssz":"......................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"風滾草探測器——可利用風力在火星地表移動","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"風滾草探測器——固定在原地，只觀察同一個地點","n":22,"ssz":"...................1.."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"本課是說明文，作者主要運用哪一種說明方法來介紹「仿生學」？","n":29,"ssz":"..............2.............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"比較說明─透過科技產品的比較來說明仿生學","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"舉例說明─透過列舉具體事例讓讀者理解仿生學","n":21,"ssz":"....................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"定義說明─直接解釋各種科技品的概念和用途","n":20,"ssz":".................1.."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"過程說明─詳細描述仿生學是如何逐步發明出來的","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"有許多語詞，可以用「拆詞釋義」的方式猜出它的意思，例如，防腐劑、危機四伏。請問底下選項中，哪一個語詞無法用「拆詞釋義」的策略來猜出它的意思？","n":70,"ssz":".......................2.......................1....................2."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一目十行","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"日新月異","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"馬馬虎虎","n":4,"ssz":"..11"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"課文末段說明了什麼是「仿生學」，請問底下選項中哪一個是「仿生學」的例子？","n":36,"ssz":".........................1........1."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"把速度最快的游泳選手取一個叫飛魚的綽號","n":19,"ssz":"............1......"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"把河馬張開大嘴的相片貼在大胃王餐廳的招牌上","n":21,"ssz":"....................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"模仿荷葉不易沾水的特性，設計不容易沾水的雨傘","n":22,"ssz":"....1................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"把虎豹的斑紋印在布料上，做成服飾，以吸引人注意","n":23,"ssz":"......................."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[0].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"＜200字","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[0].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"還要多加練習。","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[1].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"201~230字","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[1].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"嗯，還不錯喲！","n":7,"ssz":"...1..."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[2].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"＞231字","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[2].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"哇嗚，超級厲害！","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:key_reading.instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請用計時器，從指定段落（三　）開始朗讀，計時1分鐘讀的字數，並記錄在表格中。如果你計時3次後，對自己還不滿意，可以自己多練幾次喔。最後一次，找一位同學，請他來計時、記錄並簽名！","n":88,"ssz":"...............................................................1.......1................"},{"section":"served:key_reading.includes_section_heading","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"跟著太陽轉的花苞","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第1次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第2次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第3次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"裁判計時","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.unit","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"字","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:key_reading.benchmark_label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎ 我的表現","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:key_reading.start_text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"沙馬雷和一般的無人機不一樣，它只有一片翅膀，因此","n":24,"ssz":"...12......1............"},{"section":"served:text_type","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"單","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"上一課，我們學過遇到不認識的詞，可以用「拆詞釋義」推測詞義。只要拆開後的字或詞看得懂，合起來也說得通，就適合使用這個方法。\n這課要再進一步學：拆詞時，不一定要把每個字都分開，熟悉而且有完整意思的詞，可以放在一起看。遇到少數不懂的部分，也可以先利用自己看得懂的部分，再配合原句推測詞義。\n使用拆詞釋義時，可以照著四個步驟來做：\n❶拆一拆：把語詞拆開。\n❷想意思：想想每個字或詞的意思。\n❸合詞義：把各部分的意思合起來，推測整個詞義。\n❹放回句子：把推測出的詞義放回原句，讀一讀，看看是否合理。\n小提醒：如果拆開後大部分字詞都不懂，或推測的意思放回原句不合理，就表示這個詞可能不適合用「拆詞釋義」，要改用其他方法。","n":305,"ssz":".1........1.............................1.......1........1.........1........1....1.............2.......2...........1..........1...1.........................1.....................2....1.....2..........1..2.......1........1....................................1...........2............1...1.................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"上一課，我們學過遇到不認識的詞，可以用「拆詞釋義」推測詞義。只要拆開後的字或詞看得懂，合起來也說得通，就適合使用這個方法。","n":61,"ssz":".1........1.............................1.......1........1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這課要再進一步學：拆詞時，不一定要把每個字都分開，熟悉而且有完整意思的詞，可以放在一起看。遇到少數不懂的部分，也可以先利用自己看得懂的部分，再配合原句推測詞義。","n":80,"ssz":".....1........1....1.............2.......2...........1..........1...1..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"使用拆詞釋義時，可以照著四個步驟來做：","n":19,"ssz":".............1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❶拆一拆：把語詞拆開。","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❷想意思：想想每個字或詞的意思。","n":16,"ssz":"...2....1.....2."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❸合詞義：把各部分的意思合起來，推測整個詞義。","n":23,"ssz":"........1..2.......1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❹放回句子：把推測出的詞義放回原句，讀一讀，看看是否合理。","n":29,"ssz":"....1........................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小提醒：如果拆開後大部分字詞都不懂，或推測的意思放回原句不合理，就表示這個詞可能不適合用「拆詞釋義」，要改用其他方法。","n":59,"ssz":"...........1...........2............1...1.................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一、拆詞釋義練習","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"例一：向陽性","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].quote","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"句子：向日葵花苞的向陽性，讓科學家設計出能自動調整角度的仿生太陽能板。","n":35,"ssz":".1................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"紅色 ☑ 與橘框圈選（圖形，文字流無此資訊）；❸合詞義的手寫答案在文字流內","n":37,"ssz":"....................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[0].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❶拆一拆：請先用「／」把語詞拆開。拆詞不一定要逐字拆，也可以幾個字一起看。\n向陽性","n":41,"ssz":"....................1..........1.2......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[0].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❶拆一拆：請先用「／」把語詞拆開。拆詞不一定要逐字拆，也可以幾個字一起看。","n":37,"ssz":"....................1..........1.2..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[1].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"先判斷：拆開後，這些字詞的意思我都知道嗎？","n":21,"ssz":"..............2......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[1].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"都知道，可以繼續使用拆詞釋義。","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[1].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"大多不知道，先改用其他方法。","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[2].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❷想意思：請圈出比較適合的意思","n":15,"ssz":"...2..........2"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[2].items[0].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"⑴向陽：朝向陽光／指示方向","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[2].items[1].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"⑵ 性：　個性／　特性","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[3].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❸合詞義：把兩部分的意思合起來\n⑴向陽性：【　】","n":24,"ssz":"........1..2............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[3].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❸合詞義：把兩部分的意思合起來","n":15,"ssz":"........1..2..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[3].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"⑴向陽性：【　】","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[3].blanks[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"朝向陽光的特性","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[4].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❹放回句子：把上面推測的詞義放回原句，讀一讀，看看是否合理。","n":30,"ssz":"....1........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[4].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"合理","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[4].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"不合理，試其他方法","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[5].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"→你發現了嗎？拆詞時，不一定要一個字一個字拆。像「向陽性」可以拆成「向陽／性」，更容易推測出詞義喔！","n":50,"ssz":"............1...1..1............................1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"例二：廣闊無垠","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].quote","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"句子：像大球的探測器可以在廣闊無垠的火星地表上滾動。","n":26,"ssz":".1........................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"紅色 ☑ 與紅框圈選（圖形，文字流無此資訊）；❸合詞義的手寫答案在文字流內","n":37,"ssz":"....................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[0].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❶拆一拆：請先用「／」把語詞拆開。拆詞不一定要逐字拆，也可以幾個字一起看。\n廣闊無垠","n":42,"ssz":"....................1..........1.2........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[2].items[0].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"⑴廣闊：範圍很大／地面平坦","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[2].items[1].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"⑵無：沒有／很多","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[2].items[2].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"⑶垠：","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[3].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"即使不確定「垠」的意思，也可以先用熟悉的部分猜一猜。","n":26,"ssz":"..1.......2..........1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[4].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❸合詞義：把知道的意思合起來，再配合原句推測詞義\n⑴廣闊無垠可能是：【　】","n":37,"ssz":"..........2.........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[4].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❸合詞義：把知道的意思合起來，再配合原句推測詞義","n":24,"ssz":"..........2............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[4].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"⑴廣闊無垠可能是：【　】","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[4].blanks[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"範圍很大，沒有盡頭","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[5].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"查一查可以知道，「垠」是邊界，因此「廣闊無垠」是形容範圍很大，沒有邊界。","n":36,"ssz":"...................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[6].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❹放回句子：把推測的詞義放回原句，讀一讀，看看是否合理。","n":28,"ssz":"....1......................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[7].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"→你發現了嗎？拆詞後，有一個字不知道，也有機會先用熟悉的部分猜出大概意思！","n":37,"ssz":".............1...............1.....2."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].text","slug":null,"idx":nul